<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Tovarna Krmil listed on the OTC.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Tovarna Krmil listed on the OTC.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian livestock feed producer Tovarna Krmil Zalec was listed on the over-the-counter (OTC) market of the Ljubljana bourse on March 10, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company listed 126,679 shares with a nominal value of 1,000 tolars each ($6.5), representing 61.87 percent of its equity.</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
